# Copy to .sandcastle/.env (git-ignored) and fill in.
# Sandcastle forwards every key listed here into the sandbox as a `docker run
# -e` value — which lands in `docker inspect .Config.Env`, readable by
# anyone with Docker API access (the 2026-07-11 breach vector; see
# docs/architecture/07-secrets-architecture.md). So this file now only holds
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN (Anthropic's automation token has no file-based
# delivery option — see main.mts) plus non-secret config. The other bearer
# tokens ship as read-only files under /run/secrets instead (see main.mts's
# `mounts` and .sandcastle/secrets/README.md) and are consumed that way by
# list-ready-tasks.sh, preflight-triage.sh, ask-human.sh, notify-mattermost.sh,
# prompt.md, and the clan-lab skill.

# Claude Code OAuth token — get one by running `claude setup-token` on your host.
# Lets the agent use your Claude subscription instead of an API key.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# Or use an Anthropic API key instead — uncomment and fill in:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Forgejo API base for this repo. Leave empty in CI (the workflow provides it,
# and a non-empty value here would override it inside the sandbox); fill in
# only for manual host runs.
FORGEJO_API=

# Mattermost bot config (not secret — the bot token itself lives in
# .sandcastle/secrets/mattermost_bot_token, see secrets/README.md). Lets the
# agent ask a human mid-task via .sandcastle/ask-human.sh
# (needs_human_decision items). The bot must be a member of the channel:
# posting works without membership, reading thread replies does not. Leave
# empty in CI (the workflow provides them); fill in for manual host runs if
# you want mid-task questions.
MATTERMOST_URL=
MATTERMOST_CHANNEL_ID=

# The agent's Bash tool kills commands at its per-call timeout, and its
# default ceiling is far below ask-human.sh's 20-minute reply wait —
# on 2026-07-27 that killed every #129 ask mid-poll, producing seven
# duplicate Mattermost questions and a lost answer. Raise both so prompt.md
# rule 6's long-timeout ask survives (values in ms; 25 / 30 min).
BASH_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS=1500000
BASH_MAX_TIMEOUT_MS=1800000

# FORGEJO_TOKEN, MATTERMOST_BOT_TOKEN: see .sandcastle/secrets/README.md —
# they no longer go in this file.
